# The build context for ./Dockerfile is this directory — wrangler resolves it as
# the Dockerfile's parent unless `image_build_context` says otherwise — so every
# `wrangler deploy` would otherwise hand the daemon ~450 MB of node_modules and
# dist before running a single instruction.
#
# The Dockerfile has no COPY, so the correct context is empty. If you ever add
# one, un-ignore exactly the paths it needs; do not delete this file.
*
